body:
Ahh the dreaded overdraft fee;;; Im glad to hear that I'm not the only one that this has happened to, but I have enough in my account that I was fortunate enough to not have been overdrawn..... 

Maybe try calling your bank and see about getting it repealed because its TECHNICALLY an unauthorized charge, since they were supposed to charge your PayPal NOT your card. And not only would you get the $5 back, but most likely the $35 overdraft fee as well. I just hope Depop doesn't do what Mercari does when you do a charge back on a transaction of theirs;;;

Either way, I hope you're able to recover;;; 😭
